5
00:00:27.333 --> 00:00:38.000
Generated by the live date workflow. The ending stays.

6
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:48.000
The journal points each moment back to saved lines.

7
00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:55.000
Each Agent writes home independently.

8
